{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c887","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0aa3d-f870-72c3-b067-9f985ccf069d"},"sequence":670,"recorded_at":1780531400001335,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"293ce3c3-411f-4a5d-bb7d-d441c56eec01","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"293ce3c3-411f-4a5d-bb7d-d441c56eec01","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"293ce3c3-411f-4a5d-bb7d-d441c56eec01"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0aa3f-b1e1-74e0-9606-2bc53c964062"},"task_id":"01a0aa3f-b1e1-74e0-9606-2bc53c964062","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0aa3f-b1e1-74e0-9606-2bc53c964062","chunk":"Read text file `internal/hosttrust/dacl.go`.\n1|package hosttrust\n2|\n3|// aceKind classifies one DACL entry for the owner-only audit. Only explicit\n4|// allow entries grant access; deny entries grant nothing; any other entry\n5|// type has unknown grant semantics and fails closed.\n6|type aceKind int\n7|\n8|const (\n9|\taceAllow aceKind = iota\n10|\taceDeny\n11|\taceOther\n12|)\n13|\n14|// allowedACE is one DACL entry in platform-independent form: the grant kind\n15|// plus the trustee SID in string form. Platform extractors translate native\n16|// ACEs into this shape; ownerOnlyGrants decides them without native calls,\n17|// so the audit logic itself runs on every platform under test.\n18|type allowedACE struct {\n19|\tkind aceKind\n20|\tsid  string\n21|}\n22|\n23|// ownerOnlyGrants reports whether a DACL grants access exclusively to owner:\n24|// every allow entry names the owner SID, and at least one such entry exists\n25|// (an empty or deny-only DACL is unusable and refuses). Deny entries are\n26|// skipped: they grant nothing. Any other entry type refuses.\n27|func ownerOnlyGrants(owner string, aces []allowedACE) bool {\n28|\tif owner == \"\" {\n29|\t\treturn false\n30|\t}\n31|\tgranted := false\n32|\tfor _, ace := range aces {\n33|\t\tswitch ace.kind {\n34|\t\tcase aceDeny:\n35|\t\t\tcontinue\n36|\t\tcase aceAllow:\n37|\t\t\tif ace.sid != owner {\n38|\t\t\t\treturn false\n39|\t\t\t}\n40|\t\t\tgranted = true\n41|\t\tdefault:\n42|\t\t\treturn false\n43|\t\t}\n44|\t}\n45|\treturn granted\n46|}","final_result":true}}}
